        <name>Bergk 1882 (Poetae Lyrici Graeci)</name>
        <bibliography>Theodor Bergk, Poetae Lyrici Graeci, 4th ed., Vol. 2 (Leipzig: Teubner, 1882), pp. 361-373. CAVT 182 / CANT 35.</bibliography>
      </ms>
